age/asset/2146/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Klarna.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2146/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Klarna.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2146/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Klarna.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2146/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Klarna.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2146/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Klarna.jpg","#FEB4C7",[],{"contentTopicImage":52,"name":54,"slug":55},{"id":53,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":8,"assetUrlXs":8,"assetUrlSm":8,"assetUrlMd":8,"assetUrlLg":8,"assetUrlXl":8,"assetUrlXxl":8},"2429","Announcements","announcement",false,"2025-09-10","Klarna IPO - IVP",{"id":60,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":61,"assetUrlXs":62,"assetUrlSm":63,"assetUrlMd":64,"assetUrlLg":65,"assetUrlXl":66,"assetUrlXxl":67},"1871","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1871/IVP_Klarna_IPO_1200x630_090825.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1871/xs_IVP_Klarna_IPO_1200x630_090825.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1871/sm_IVP_Klarna_IPO_1200x630_090825.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1871/md_IVP_Klarna_IPO_1200x630_090825.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1871/lg_IVP_Klarna_IPO_1200x630_090825.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1871/xl_IVP_Klarna_IPO_1200x630_090825.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1871/xxl_IVP_Klarna_IPO_1200x630_090825.jpg",{"id":69,"alt":7,"caption":7,"assetUrl":8,"assetUrlXs":8,"assetUrlSm":8,"assetUrlMd":8,"assetUrlLg":8,"assetUrlXl":8,"assetUrlXxl":8},"1873",[71,83],{"instance":72},{"__typename":73,"heading":7,"image":74},"FullImage",{"id":75,"alt":7,"caption":7,"assetUrl":76,"assetUrlXs":77,"assetUrlSm":78,"assetUrlMd":79,"assetUrlLg":80,"assetUrlXl":81,"assetUrlXxl":82},"1874","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1874/Klarna_IPO_Header_Image_resized.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1874/xs_Klarna_IPO_Header_Image_resized.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1874/sm_Klarna_IPO_Header_Image_resized.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1874/md_Klarna_IPO_Header_Image_resized.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1874/lg_Klarna_IPO_Header_Image_resized.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1874/xl_Klarna_IPO_Header_Image_resized.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1874/xxl_Klarna_IPO_Header_Image_resized.jpg",{"instance":84},{"__typename":85,"largeHeading":7,"heading":7,"body":86},"TextBlock","Twenty years ago, Sebastian Siemiatkowski and two friends at the Stockholm School of Economics started a company after realizing how hard it was for small businesses to collect payments from online customers. \r\n\r\nToday, we want to congratulate Klarna — founded in Europe, they have grown to become one of the largest and most successful fintech companies in the world — on their IPO.\r\n\r\nBefore Sebastian changed the world of finance, he changed the culture at IVP. While virtual presentations are common today, back in 2014, it was tradition for CEOs to come to Silicon Valley to give a presentation to the partnership before we finalized an investment. Because Sebastian was halfway around the world, he presented over a very early video call. \r\n\r\nBut even over a spotty connection, we could tell that Klarna was special.\r\n\r\nWhat struck us most was Sebastian’s unwavering belief in Klarna’s mission. Though the idea of layaway wasn’t new, he and his team had adapted the “buy now, pay later” concept for the digital age. And while the company was founded in Sweden, it was clear their aspirations were to build for merchants and consumers globally.\r\n\r\nThat unshakeable confidence led to our initial investment. And it’s why we helped Klarna buy the German payment processing company Sofort. This methodical expansion from the Nordics to the continent and then the UK ultimately led to successful expansion into the US, which is now its largest market by revenue. \r\n\r\nAlong the way, Klarna has focused on creating long-term value, turning a profit for 18 out of its 21 years in existence. The team also embraced new technology, as evidenced by the fact that two-thirds of its customer service interactions are now handled by AI.\r\n\r\nAlong the way, we’ve helped introduce Klarna to potential customers and leadership hires in the U.S. And now we’re glad to see Klarna going public at a time that’s right for the business.\r\n\r\nBen Graham, an American financial analyst and mentor of Warren Buffett’s, famously said that, “In the short run, the market is a voting machine, but in the long run it is a weighing machine.” While it’s impossible to predict what the market will do in the short term, over the long term, we believe that investors will appreciate the incredible business Sebastian and team have built. \r\n\r\nWe can’t wait to see what’s next.",{"id":88,"assetUrl":8},"503",{"assetUrl":8},[],"from-stockholm-to-the-stock-market-klarnas-remarkable-journey-to-ipo",[93],{"fullName":94,"teamSubcategories":95,"slug":118,"image":119,"abbreviatedTitle":128,"focusAreas":129,"emailAddress":130,"bio":131},"Eric Liaw",[96,102,106,110,114],{"name":97,"slug":98,"teamCategory":99},"All","investors-all",{"name":100,"slug":101},"Investors","investors",{"name":103,"slug":104,"teamCategory":105},"Apps","apps",{"name":100,"slug":101},{"name":107,"slug":108,"teamCategory":109},"Consumer","consumer",{"name":100,"slug":101},{"name":111,"slug":112,"teamCategory":113},"Digital Health","digital-health",{"name":100,"slug":101},{"name":115,"slug":116,"teamCategory":117},"Fintech & Crypto","fintech-crypto",{"name":100,"slug":101},"eric-liaw",{"id":120,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":121,"assetUrlXs":122,"assetUrlSm":123,"assetUrlMd":124,"assetUrlLg":125,"assetUrlXl":126,"assetUrlXxl":127},"2353","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","General Partner","Enterprise Software, Gaming & AR2, Bottom-Up Solutions, Consumer, FinTech","eliaw@ivp.com","I came to IVP not only for what we do but how we do it. We partner with entrepreneurs right as they approach an inflection point—the moment when identifying and equipping an organization with the right ingredients can make an astronomical difference in its trajectory. Together, we’re able to shape the future of high-growth startups and, as a result, the future of our world.\r\n\r\nIt’s a true privilege to work with entrepreneurs and founders who are pushing the envelope to solve pressing issues that serve their customers. Supporting those founders with hard work is its own reward. My commitment to entrepreneurs is to be available whenever they need me.",{"id":133,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":134,"assetUrlXs":135,"assetUrlSm":136,"assetUrlMd":137,"assetUrlLg":138,"assetUrlXl":139,"assetUrlXxl":140},"1872","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1872/IVP_Klarna_IPO_800x880_B_090925.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1872/xs_IVP_Klarna_IPO_800x880_B_090925.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1872/sm_IVP_Klarna_IPO_800x880_B_090925.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1872/md_IVP_Klarna_IPO_800x880_B_090925.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1872/lg_IVP_Klarna_IPO_800x880_B_090925.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1872/xl_IVP_Klarna_IPO_800x880_B_090925.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1872/xxl_IVP_Klarna_IPO_800x880_B_090925.jpg","From Stockholm to the Stock Market: Klarna’s Remarkable Journey to IPO",1790351925281]